  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990149/description_7e6e939d-955a-4560-add0-b46a31a1e865.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990149/description_af2a64af-1930-4b6d-ab80-a60736ce8adf.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990149/description_6e02649d-5999-4f25-8e03-338958e3fb7c.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990149/description_a9587c26-f702-408a-8c48-e91dda063bfb.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990149/description_4fa38b48-e394-4632-b818-3cf2289082ef.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>📓 <strong>自訂角色選擇系統 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/otherworld-origins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">種族與職業系統</a>（角色表），包含戲法與專長</strong></p><p><strong>🎖️ RPG 等級制敵人，附帶 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/otherworld-apotheosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">傳奇裝備</a>戰利品、以及為幽暗地域亞種與建築師設計的強化重鑄系統</strong></p><p><strong>📈 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/justleveling-fork\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">角色成長與升級</a>，透過遊戲過程解鎖能力與屬性</strong></p><p><strong>⛰️ 龐大的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tectonic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇幻世界生成</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇幻生態系</a></strong></p><p><strong>🏘️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lukis-grand-capitals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">首都城市</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">強化的村莊</a></strong></p><p><strong>🧝🏻 奇幻住民，如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-orcs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">獸人</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goblins-tyranny\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">哥布林</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">巨龍</a></strong></p><p><strong>🪙 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/numismatic-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">貨幣系統</a>，包含金幣與銀幣，以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bountiful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">村莊懸賞</a></strong></p><p><strong>🔧 大量獨家修正補丁，將所有內容融合為一個具凝聚力且平衡的 RPG 系統</strong></p><p><strong>⚔️ 沉浸式戰役將一切串聯起來，包含全新維度、結構變化、儀式、劇情與背景故事！</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1418133/description_c533b39e-d824-40b7-9e28-6370d16881d0.png\" alt=\"image\"><em><a href=\"https://discord.gg/LunaPixel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0Qp_lkAVsvU\" width=\"800\" height=\"448\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eojLV6R_QpY\" width=\"800\" height=\"448\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></a></em></p><p><em><a href=\"https://discord.gg/LunaPixel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/990149/description_d840ee50-ebee-4996-8a0e-fbb68893f85c.png\" alt=\"\"></a> 俄語翻譯擴充包（社群製作，未經官方驗證，機器翻譯）<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/otherworld-dnd-rus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此！</a></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
